"currently selected language pair. CSV/TSV rows may use source_text and "
"translated_text columns, or a single target - source line per row. Plain-"
"text and Markdown files use one target - source entry per line (spaces "
"around the hyphen are optional). Other fields (notes, date_added) are "
"optional."
